factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The tamil_headline, reel_script, slides_spec and caption say the raids happened in Velampalayam (வேலம்பாளையம்) as a place separate from Tiruppur, but the article mentions Velampalayam only as the location of the Sornapuri Layout where the contractor's house was raided; the headline lists it as a separate location alongside Tiruppur and Avinashi, which is acceptable but the reel_script and caption phrasing 'திருப்பூர் வேலம்பாளையம் சொர்ணபுரி லே அவுட்டில்' runs the place names together in a way that can be read as different places than the article states.
  The slides_spec line 'திருப்பூர், வேலம்பாளையம், சொர்ணபுரி லே அவுட்டில் ஒரு' is an incomplete sentence with no clear meaning; it omits the word for 'contractor's house' (ஒப்பந்ததாரர் வீடு) that appears in the article.
  The reel_script and caption say the raids were 'நேற்று தமிழகம் முழுவதும் பல மாவட்டங்களில்' (across several districts of Tamil Nadu), but the article only says police raided simultaneously in various districts across Tamil Nadu on the previous day, while the specific Tiruppur-district events are reported separately; the caption also states the Tiruppur district Vigilance police and Chennai team took part, which is supported, but the reel_script omits the fact that the raids were simultaneous across the state in a way that makes the Tiruppur events sound like part of a single statewide operation without clarifying the source.
  The slides_spec 'hl2' headline and 'எங்கே சோதனை?' slide say the Avinashi raid was at a 'டிரான்ஸ்போர்ட் அலுவலகம்' which matches the article, but the slide line 'அவருக்கு சொந்தமான பூலுவபட்டி அலுவலகம்' drops the word 'அலுவலகம்' context of the contractor and omits that the Bhuluvapatti office belongs to the same contractor, making the ownership link ambiguous.
